002F\u002Fcuriousbarbell.com\u002Fsubscribe\u002F\n 加入好奇槓鈴社團！https:\u002F\u002Fwww.facebook.com\u002Fgroups\u002F2692476911006899\u002F\n  IG https:\u002F\u002Fwww.instagram.com\u002Fcuriousbarbell\u002F\n\n\n在其他平台收聽：\n\n  Spotify: https:\u002F\u002Fspoti.fi\u002F2qeqEfT\n  Apple Podcast https:\u002F\u002Fapple.co\u002F2pPzr7K\n  Youtube: https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F37iC42H\n  Google Podcast https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F2S8aEpq\n  Overcast, Anchor、Castro、Pocket Cast, Breaker\n\n","duration":462915,"episodeId":"e88qpn","episodeImage":"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com\u002Fanchor-generated-image-bank\u002Fproduction\u002Fpodcast_uploaded_episode400\u002F2560247\u002F2560247-1576661619713-3057d9822ef49.jpg","shareLinkPath":"\u002Fcuriousbarbell\u002Fepisodes\u002F1--by-Angie-e88qpn","shareLinkEmbedPath":"\u002Fcuriousbarbell\u002Fembed\u002Fepisodes\u002F1--by-Angie-e88qpn","stationId":"fdb36fc","title":"#1. 跟好奇槓鈴一起探索健身重訓與人生by Angie","spotifyUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fopen.spotify.com\u002Fepisode\u002F3f4OlDAWsS2RrnMpV7Tt8h"}],"shareLinkPath":"\u002Fcuriousbarbell\u002Fepisodes\u002F17--GYMEFIT--ft--GYMEFIT-Jimmy-eb4vef","shareLinkEmbedPath":"\u002Fcuriousbarbell\u002Fembed\u002Fepisodes\u002F17--GYMEFIT--ft--GYMEFIT-Jimmy-eb4vef","title":"#17 創辦 GYMEFIT 之路 ft. GYMEFIT 創辦人Jimmy楊浚泯","isV3Episode":true,"created":"2020-02-28T21:07:18.000Z","publishOn":"2020-02-28T21:32:36.000Z","episodeEnclosureUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fanchor.fm\u002Fs\u002Ffdb36fc\u002Fpodcast\u002Fplay\u002F10697615\u002Fhttps%3A%2F%2Fd3ctxlq1ktw2nl.cloudfront.net%2Fproduction%2F2020-1-28%2F53330304-44100-2-1b8589f4f342e.mp3"},"episodes":{"episodes":[],"isFetching":false,"isCreating":false},"errorModal":{"error":null},"localStorage":{"lastPlayedSegment":{}},"pageMetadata":{"description":"*本集專訪原本收錄於GYMEFIT教練內心話系列，你也可以到GYMEFIT官方Youtube收看這次專訪系列的精美影片．\n＊搶先收到最新活動通知 https:\u002F\u002Fcuriousbarbell.com\u002Fsubscribe\u002F\n本集Jimmy分享\n\n 健身緣起、捷克時期的健美訓練\n 從工程師轉職的過程、入行時的懷疑與期許\n  創業前的恐懼與解決方法\n  創業需要的特質、對創業的想像、以及創業挑戰\n  創業過程的認知與自我改變、成家對於管理的影響\n  深受啟發的決策原則\n  GYMEFIT 兩家店的不同定位\n  作為人的基本價值與信念、如何釐清心底真正的渴望\n  什麼是極限體能王\n\n＊馬上訂閱好奇槓鈴！聆聽更多運動健身領域的教練、創業家、醫療專業人員、以及運動研究工作者分享訓練相關的專業知識以及他們的人生故事．\n延伸資源：\n\n  GYMEFIT https:\u002F\u002Fgymefit.tw\u002F\n  本集專訪影片版 https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F388vDhR\n  Anything You Want by Derek Sivers https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F2VxAIOi\n  Tim Ferriss Fear Setting https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F2PuZN8A\n  精實創業 https:\u002F\u002Fwww.books.com.tw\u002Fproducts\u002F0010768288\n\n在其他下平台收聽：\n\n  Spotify: https:\u002F\u002Fspoti.fi\u002F2qeqEfT\n  Apple Podcast https:\u002F\u002Fapple.co\u002F2pPzr7K\n  Youtube: https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F37iC42H\n  Google Podcast https:\u002F\u002Fbit.ly\u002F2S8aEpq\n  Overcast, Anchor、Castro、Pocket Cast, Breaker\n\nContacts:\n\n  Facebook & IG搜尋: Curious Barbell\n  Website: curiousbarbell.com\n  E-mail: angie@curiousbarbell.com\n","keywords":"podcast hosting,free podcast hosting,make a podcast,making a podcast,create a podcast,creating a podcast,podcast sponsorships,sponsor a podcast,free,audio,recording,audio clip,anchor,podcasts,voice,microphone,podcast,podcast creation,record,conversation,discussion,talk,talking,radio,public radio,npr,startup,talk radio","image":"https:\u002F\u002Fd3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduction\u002Fpodcast_uploaded_episode400\u002F2560247\u002F2560247-1582925562498-260097a5794f4.jpg","imageWidth":1200,"imageHeight":630,"twitterImage":"https:\u002F\u002Fd3t3ozftmdmh3i.cloudfront.net\u002Fproduction\u002Fpodcast_uploaded_episode400\u002F2560247\u002F2560247-1582925562498-260097a5794f4.jpg","twitterCard":"summary_large_image","facebookType":"website","oEmbedTitle":"#17 創辦 GYMEFIT 之路 ft. GYMEFIT 創辦人Jimmy楊浚泯 by Curious Barbell 好奇槓鈴-健身與人生的對話","oEmbedUrl":"https:\u002F\u002Fanchor.fm\u002Fpod\u002Fapi\u002Fv3\u002Fepisodes\u002Feb4vef\u002Foembed?title=%2317%20%E5%89%B5%E8%BE%A6%20GYMEFIT%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF%20ft.%20GYMEFIT%20%E5%89%B5%E8%BE%A6%E4%BA%BAJimmy%E6%A5%8A%E6%B5%9A%E6%